  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Classes",
    "section": "3.40",
    "heading": "Level 2: Jack of All Trades",
    "lineStart": 2494,
    "lineEnd": 2498
  },
  "section": "3.40",
  "rulesText": "You can add half your Proficiency Bonus (round down) to any ability check you make that uses a skill proficiency you lack and that doesn't otherwise use your Proficiency Bonus.\n\nFor example, if you make a Strength (Athletics) check and lack Athletics proficiency, you can add half your Proficiency Bonus to the check."
}
